{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:43 2026-11-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:43 2026-11-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:43 2026-11-17 HKT</p><img alt=\"中年男女赴滙豐總行開戶 涉用假文件被捕。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a160aedc6ce20076b4690b9fdf7d49bb/2026-11/BF260804HSBC19.jpg\"/><p>中環皇后大道中滙豐總行，今日（11月17日）下午3時許有職員報案，表示有人用虛假文書打算開戶。警員接報到場，經初步調查，將52歲姓邢男子及53歲姓金女子，以涉嫌「行使虛假文書」將他們拘捕扣查。目前案件由中區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:55:32.544541+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T14:43:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T01:37:08.182141+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:48:58.242499+00:00","content_hash":"5d871b4a72e457c61f29b71d251cc6dfe6b4afb0f313c581b0b62523d698c2b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}